# Local Rally room state.
# `.rally/ledger.jsonl` IS committed — it is the canonical, append-only,
# durable record of every fact in this repo's rally point. It survives
# clone/machine with no external service. Everything else under .rally/
# is a derived cache (facts.db, room.db, cursors.json, tmp files) that
# `rally` rebuilds from the ledger on first open.
.rally/*
!.rally/ledger.jsonl
.rally2/

# Generated build-loop runtime state
.build-loop/state.json
.build-loop/worktree-gc-last.txt

# uv lockfile — library-style project; downstream pipx installs resolve own deps.
uv.lock
